DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     rrmmggrroouupp deletes the specified UNIX _g_r_o_u_p from group database.  rrmmggrroouupp
     will not delete the system groups wheel, daemon, kmem, sys, tty, opera‐
     tor, bin, nogroup, nobody, or groups with gid 0.  Do not delete these
     groups.

